1
00:00:00,075 --> 00:00:01,295
You touch a doorknob

2
00:00:01,295 --> 00:00:02,450
and get zapped

3
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:04,840
by THOUSANDS of volts!

4
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:05,980
Relax,

5
00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:07,018
that spark came out

6
00:00:07,018 --> 00:00:08,300
of YOU.

7
00:00:08,350 --> 00:00:09,310
Every step,

8
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:10,254
your shoes scrape

9
00:00:10,254 --> 00:00:11,800
electrons off the carpet,

10
00:00:11,854 --> 00:00:13,800
and they pile onto you.

11
00:00:13,839 --> 00:00:14,904
In dry air,

12
00:00:14,904 --> 00:00:16,067
they can't escape...

13
00:00:16,090 --> 00:00:17,701
till your finger nears metal,

14
00:00:17,701 --> 00:00:18,738
and they ALL

15
00:00:18,738 --> 00:00:19,733
jump.

16
00:00:19,789 --> 00:00:21,867
A tiny bolt of lightning.

17
00:00:21,919 --> 00:00:22,851
We noticed this

18
00:00:22,851 --> 00:00:25,500
twenty-six hundred years ago...

19
00:00:25,531 --> 00:00:27,026
and STILL can't fully

20
00:00:27,026 --> 00:00:28,267
explain it.

21
00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:30,147
So technically...

22
00:00:30,147 --> 00:00:32,570
the doorknob is the VICTIM.

